{"reviews":[{"id":"B01N7ODHA0-0","r":3.0,"t":"Instructions in Broken English, Pores Semi-clean","x":"The &#34;instructions&#34; are incomprehensible, but I figured what the hell. It seemed to work on clearing the minor blackheads. Do not get it near facial hair. Put it on thick or you'll have to wash/wipe it off with warm water. I might use it again on my nose or forehead, but would not use it as a complete mask.","h":8,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2017"},{"id":"B01N7ODHA0-1","r":1.0,"t":"Save Your Money","x":"This didn't help &#34;cleanse&#34; my skin. In fact, all it did was rip off some of the fine hairs on my face. Also, some of the black stuff got into my pores and didn't peel off with the rest of the mask, so I had to rewash my face after peeling it off. Huge disappointment and a waste of money. Never again.","h":8,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2017"},{"id":"B01N7ODHA0-2","r":2.0,"t":"don't believe the hype","x":"I bought this because of all the viral internet rage. 1. peeling it off your face really doesnt hurt as bad as some video commentary might suggest. 2. it didn't really remove any blackheads/white heads... mostly just peach fuzz hairs on my face and some dead skin. I even tried it on just my nose and not my whole face and it didn't remove anything.... Biore pore strips 4 lyfe.","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2017"},{"id":"B01N7ODHA0-3","r":3.0,"t":"Three Stars","x":"It didn't pull out the black heads on my daughters face.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2017"},{"id":"B01N7ODHA0-4","r":2.0,"t":"Idk if it's because I put a thin layer but ...","x":"Idk if it's because I put a thin layer but after removing the mask I still had visible dead skin and blackheads on my nose.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2017"},{"id":"B01N7ODHA0-5","r":3.0,"t":"Black heads didn't remove","x":"First time trying & didn't really remove the black heads on the first try. Gonna apply again and see what happens .","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2017"},{"id":"B01N7ODHA0-6","r":4.0,"t":"Not bad the first time!","x":"So far so good. Only used it once so far but it's working great!","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2017"},{"id":"B01N7ODHA0-7","r":3.0,"t":"Ouch!","x":"This went on easily and dried fairly quickly but good luck taking it off without crying.  This HURT!!! It does really seem to remove black heads but OUCH!!! Also, did anyone read the instructions on the bottle?  Haha, it's laughable how poorly they are written.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2017"},{"id":"B01N7ODHA0-8","r":5.0,"t":"Everyone who wants GREAT skin needs this!","x":"This peel off mask changed my skin, made it smooth and touchable, even acne free. I've been suffering with acne for about 8 years and this mask erased the scars and pimples after the mask was on for 20 minutes. This is definitely going to be a product I buy regularly.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2017"},{"id":"B01N7ODHA0-9","r":1.0,"t":"Horrible horrible horrible","x":"Absolutely horrible, I never take time to review, but this product hurt unbelievably badly to use, did nothing to clean my pores and caused me to break out with dozens of tiny little zits two days later. Absolutely disgusting.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2017"},{"id":"B01N7ODHA0-10","r":1.0,"t":"It was like you see in the videos","x":"Product directions weren't clear. It was like you see in the videos.. hard to get off and painful! Didn't make my face smooth or remove any black heads. Wouldn't recommend.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2017"},{"id":"B01N7ODHA0-11","r":1.0,"t":"A whole lotta ouch...","x":"Didn't work. Extremely painful with zero results. The instructions on the container are poorly written and even worse on the insert.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2017"},{"id":"B01N7ODHA0-12","r":1.0,"t":"One Star","x":"did not work at all now i got to look gain so i can get the right product.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2017"},{"id":"B01N7ODHA0-13","r":1.0,"t":"One Star","x":"Shipping was fast and great but the product itself, wasn't was I expected.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2017"},{"id":"B01N7ODHA0-14","r":3.0,"t":"Three Stars","x":"This doesn't work like the original but it's acceptable","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2017"},{"id":"B01N7ODHA0-15","r":4.0,"t":"Definitely not as painful as people make it out to be in videos ...","x":"Definitely not as painful as people make it out to be in videos I've seen online. It's not like a typical peel off mask it does sting a little bit like a bandaid being pulled but it's not unbearable. You can see what it pulls out which is kinda cool, although after using it it did leave some blackheads behind. My face definitely felt and looked a lot more clear afterward though.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2017"},{"id":"B01N7ODHA0-16","r":4.0,"t":"Great mask","x":"I'm not sure that this is the one that I keep seeing everyone do, but it doesn't hurt that badly to pull off. It is more painful than a regular mask, but not the way these people are acting. Make sure you steam your pores before, and run your face in cold water after. It really opens up your pores, and you will have the biggest black heads you can imagine if you don't.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2017"},{"id":"B01N7ODHA0-17","r":2.0,"t":"... but instructions and other content written on product looks like they were written by a 6 year old","x":"Product is made by beauty USA but instructions and other content written on product looks like they were written by a 6 year old. Product didn't do anything other than peel off dead skin a very few blackheads even after using other products recommended to open up pores and clean your face. Wouldn't buy again or recommend it to anyone.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2017"},{"id":"B01N7ODHA0-18","r":3.0,"t":"It's a nice product, but I wouldn't recommend","x":"It's a nice product, but I wouldn't recommend. You have to cake it on your face for it to come off. If not you're going to have to spend your time washing it off in the sink. I don't feel as though it effectively cleaned the dirt out of my pores. Used it twice since I purchased it and I do not see a noticeable difference.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2017"},{"id":"B01N7ODHA0-19","r":4.0,"t":"It hurts like a b*****","x":"It hurts like a b*****, but it is so worth it! Don't peel it off when you think it is dry though, wait about 30-40 minutes before peeling for maximum results.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2017"},{"id":"B01N7ODHA0-20","r":2.0,"t":"Do not buy","x":"Very poor product. It took maybe 2-3 black heads off my nose. This mask takes all little peach fuzz off your face but not any blackheads. Waste of money.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2017"},{"id":"B01N7ODHA0-21","r":1.0,"t":"the BIore strips work much better.","x":"The English translation on the box was enough to make me skeptical of this product .  Doesn't really do the job, the BIore strips work much better .","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2017"},{"id":"B01N7ODHA0-22","r":1.0,"t":"Spend your $ on something that works","x":"Wiggity wack!!! Dont waste ur $!! I decided to buy the product, because there were mixed reviews. This is what i get for giving it a try anyway.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2017"},{"id":"B01N7ODHA0-23","r":1.0,"t":"Don't waste your money","x":"Don't waste your money.  It was more of a hair remover than blackhead remover and I broke out severely after. STAY AWAY!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2017"},{"id":"B01N7ODHA0-24","r":1.0,"t":"Not worth it","x":"Hurts to take off but didn't see much improvement at all","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2017"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers say the mask did not remove blackheads or whiteheads as expected.","cites":[2,3,4,5,6,11,13]},{"text":"Several reviewers report the mask is very painful to peel off.","cites":[8,10,11,12]},{"text":"Multiple reviewers complain that the instructions are poorly written or unclear.","cites":[1,8,11,12]},{"text":"Some reviewers say the mask mainly removed peach fuzz or fine hairs rather than cleaning pores.","cites":[2,3]},{"text":"A few reviewers had positive results, with smoother skin or blackheads removed.","cites":[7,8,9]}]},"qa":[]}